{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassTheory.PairGraphRegimeTrichotomy","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassTheory.PairGraphRegimeTrichotomy","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":10,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.PairGraphRegime.maxContacts_eq_choose_two_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.PairGraphRegime.maxContacts_eq_choose_two_iff","kind":"theorem","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/pair-graph-regime-trichotomy.lean#L101-L112","doc":"The deltahedral contact graph is the complete graph `K_A` exactly for `2 ≤ A ≤ 4`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.PairGraphRegime.maxContacts","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.PairGraphRegime.maxContacts","kind":"def","line":97,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/pair-graph-regime-trichotomy.lean#L97-L99","doc":"The corpus's deltahedral max-contact count\n(`computations/gap1_max_contact_a5plus.py::max_contacts`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.PairGraphRegime.cutoffs_eq_structural","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.PairGraphRegime.cutoffs_eq_structural","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/pair-graph-regime-trichotomy.lean#L76-L95","doc":"The demoted block's cut-offs are the structural predicates (for `A ≥ 2`):\n`A ≤ 2 ↔ C(A,3) = 0`, and `3 ≤ A ≤ 4 ↔ (C(A,3) > 0 ∧ C(A,2) ≤ 3A − 6)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.PairGraphRegime.regime_trichotomy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.PairGraphRegime.regime_trichotomy","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/pair-graph-regime-trichotomy.lean#L61-L74","doc":"**Regime trichotomy.** For every `A ≥ 2` exactly the following holds:\n* `A = 2`         and `K_A` has no triangle;\n* `A ∈ {3, 4}`    and `K_A` has a triangle and `C(A,2) = 3A − 6`;\n* `A ≥ 5`         and `K_A` has a triangle and `3A − 6 < C(A,2)`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:pair-graph-regime-trichotomy","label":"prop:pair-graph-regime-trichotomy","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/pair-graph-regime-trichotomy.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.PairGraphRegime.euler_lt_choose_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.PairGraphRegime.euler_lt_choose_two","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/pair-graph-regime-trichotomy.lean#L52-L59","doc":"`C(A,2) > 3A − 6` for `A ≥ 5`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.PairGraphRegime.choose_two_eq_euler_of","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.PairGraphRegime.choose_two_eq_euler_of","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/pair-graph-regime-trichotomy.lean#L48-L50","doc":"`C(A,2) = 3A − 6` for `A ∈ {3, 4}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.PairGraphRegime.cast_euler","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.PairGraphRegime.cast_euler","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/pair-graph-regime-trichotomy.lean#L42-L46","doc":"For `A ≥ 2`, `3A − 6` (truncated in ℕ) casts to the integer `3A − 6`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.PairGraphRegime.choose_three_eq_zero_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.PairGraphRegime.choose_three_eq_zero_iff","kind":"theorem","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/pair-graph-regime-trichotomy.lean#L38-L40","doc":"The complete pair graph `K_A` has a triangle iff `A ≥ 3`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.PairGraphRegime.choose_two_sub_euler","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.PairGraphRegime.choose_two_sub_euler","kind":"theorem","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/pair-graph-regime-trichotomy.lean#L32-L36","doc":"**Key identity.** `2·(C(A,2) − (3A − 6)) = (A − 3)(A − 4)` over `ℤ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MassCore.PairGraphRegime.two_mul_choose_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MassCore.PairGraphRegime.two_mul_choose_two","kind":"theorem","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/pair-graph-regime-trichotomy.lean#L23-L30","doc":"`2·C(A,2) = A(A−1)` over `ℤ` (no truncated subtraction). ","signatureChunk":0}]}